        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A premium beauty e-commerce brand whose Meta Ads were running but returning under 1.5x."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "No campaign structure, outdated creative, no retargeting and a Pixel that missed a third of purchases. Spend was being judged on numbers that were wrong."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Pixel and Conversions API audit: 30% of purchases were not being recorded",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Campaign restructure across prospecting, consideration and conversion",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Creative refresh: UGC-style product videos briefed, shot and tested weekly",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Catalogue and dynamic retargeting",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Abandoned-cart email flow tied to the Meta retargeting audiences",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "ROAS went from 1.4x to 4.2x over four months on the same budget. The abandoned-cart flow added 18% revenue on top."
        }
      ]
    },
